Package: corrplotng
Title: Next Generation Correlation Plots
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("corrplot-ng contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "maintainers@example.invalid")
Description: An experimental R adapter for corrplot-ng. It retains a
    legacy-compatible plotting path through the upstream corrplot package and
    provides an experimental scene-v1 preparation path, normalized matrix and
    file input adapters, pairwise correlation testing, and palette/color-legend
    helpers. The scene path prepares renderer-neutral data; it is not a complete
    plotting renderer.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Imports:
    corrplot (>= 0.95),
    utils
Suggests:
    jsonlite,
    png,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
